### ============================================
### CLÍNICA VETERINARIA - API CRUD
### Servidor: http://localhost:3000
### ============================================

### 1. GET - Listar todos los animales
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/animals

###

### 2. GET - Obtener un animal por ID (id=1)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/animals/1

###

### 3. POST - Crear un nuevo animal (PERRO)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/animals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Toby",
  "species": "perro",
  "breed": "Yorkshire",
  "age": 1,
  "weight": 2.8,
  "ownerId": 4,
  "active": true,
  "medicalHistory": ["Vacunación inicial"],
  "lastVisit": "2026-08-01"
}

###

### 4. POST - Crear un nuevo animal (GATO)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/animals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Michi",
  "species": "gato",
  "breed": "Siamés",
  "age": 2,
  "weight": 4.5,
  "ownerId": 5,
  "active": true,
  "medicalHistory": ["Esterilización"],
  "lastVisit": "2026-07-15"
}

###

### 5. PUT - Actualizar un animal (id=1)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/animals/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Max",
  "species": "perro",
  "breed": "Golden Retriever",
  "age": 4,
  "weight": 33.5,
  "ownerId": 1,
  "active": true,
  "medicalHistory": ["Vacunación anual", "Desparasitación"],
  "lastVisit": "2026-08-01"
}

###

### 6. DELETE - Eliminar un animal (id=3)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/animals/3

###

### 7. GET - Verificar que el animal fue eliminado (debe dar 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/animals/3

###

### 8. GET - Probar ID inválido (debe dar 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/animals/abc

###

### 9. GET - Ruta inexistente (debe dar 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/animales

###

### 10. POST - Intentar crear sin campos requeridos (debe dar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/animals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "SoloNombre"
}